            <ArticleTitle>Occupational asthma: &quot;the big picture&quot;.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>335-58</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>With more than 200 agents inducing occupational asthma, an organized approach to identify the impact of both low- and high-molecular-weight agents is important. In this report, our goal is to explain the general categories of the sensitizing agents, present guidelines regarding what might be expected when exposures and sensitization occur, and present a number of references that can be explored to find information regarding the outcome of those with these illnesses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
